WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
When it’s time to clear the way for something new,
trust a team that gets it done right.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
DL Equipment and Aggregates has been your go-to crew
for professional, reliable demolition services across Saint Lucia.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:23.000
We specialise in demolition of commercial buildings,
hotels and also houses.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
We also do commercial renovations and construction,
road works, land development and trucking of all sizes.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.000
No job is too big or too tough.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.000
We bring the equipment, the experience and the commitment
to leave every customer 100% satisfied.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Need us on your next project?

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Call us today at 450-5997 or 719-6705.

